# 轻拼 LightCollage · Git 属性（行尾与二进制规则）
# 本仓库为 Windows 项目：批处理/脚本/C# 源码统一检出为 CRLF，文档与文本用 LF；
# 图片、字体、压缩包等按二进制处理，禁止行尾转换与文本 diff。

# ===== 默认：自动识别文本，仓库内统一 LF 存储 =====
* text=auto

# ===== Windows 脚本与源码：强制 CRLF =====
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.cs text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.manifest text eol=crlf

# ===== 文档 / 纯文本：LF =====
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

# ===== 二进制资源：不做文本处理 =====
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.avif binary
*.heic binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary

# ===== 字体（如后续加入）：二进制 =====
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
